# O10-YOUTUBE acceptance (tests/probes/listening-o10y-acceptance.py), owned by the acceptance author.
# The target: every check passes. On main e45d947 all fail except 3a 3f 3g 3i 3j 4i (they guard what must stay).
# 3i accepts 'Use as ambience' or 'Play as ambience' as the ambience-mode primary (the word belongs to the Listen lane).
3a a YouTube search lists results
3b on-demand results have Play as the primary action, never Tune in
3c every result row reads Play, Watch (Watch with sound), then the menu
3d the row Watch button says "Watch with sound"
3e the row menu is Show as scene, Play as ambience, Save as station, Open elsewhere, in that order
3f searching and opening row menus is inert (no command, no effect, no player)
3g a live result keeps Tune in as its primary action
3h the YouTube link sheet offers Play, Watch, Show as scene, Play as ambience, Open elsewhere, in that order
3i in ambience mode a YouTube result keeps the ambience action primary
3j in ambience mode no Watch button shows on the row
3k in ambience mode the row menu holds Watch and Play as music
3l choosing Watch in ambience mode ends the mode and starts the video
1a Watch sends one video start for that result and nothing else
1b no controller request was made on the GTK thread
1c one player window with sound opens (the video window), and no music, ambience or scene starts
1d the room pauses the way Quiet does, with the resume offer recorded
1e the video itself keeps playing
1f Now shows "Watching · title" with Stop watching
1g Stop watching sends video stop and closes the window
1h stopping offers Resume in a toast
1i it never auto-resumes
1j the Watching chip is gone after Stop watching
1k Resume resumes the room explicitly
1l when the video window closes, Now drops the Watching chip and offers Resume
1m ... and still does not resume by itself
1n with no room, Watch only starts the video (no room, no pause, no resume offer)
1o with no room, Now still shows Watching with Stop watching
1p with no room, stopping offers no Resume
2a Show as scene sends one picture link for that result
2b only the picture layer changes
2c no sound starts or stops: music and ambience untouched, no video window
2d the room is marked Changed
2e and Save as my room is offered
4a the YouTube scope shows your saved YouTube at once, before any search finishes
4b a "For Midnight library" shelf appears before typing
4c its queries are built from the room (its tags), not tracked
4d a Live now shelf appears with live streams that Tune in
4e shelf videos offer Play and Watch, never Tune in
4f shelves load off the GTK thread (worst gap @@ ms)
4g browsing shelves is inert: no command, no effect, no player, no window
4h no yt-dlp call uses an account (cookies or personal feeds)
4i the YouTube scope never asks to sign in
4j the shelves are cached on disk
4k reopening shows the cached shelves at once
4l a cached shelf says when it was updated
4m a fresh cache is not refetched (refresh at most hourly)
4n a cache older than an hour is refreshed in the background
4o a failed refresh never empties the shelf
4p saved YouTube shows without yt-dlp (zero network)
